    "practicalExamples": ["All government contracts must be 'in the name of' the President or Governor.","Authorized officers sign contracts on behalf of the President/Governor.","Non-compliant contracts may be unenforceable — but courts may grant quantum meruit.","Government e-procurement portals (GeM) standardize contract procedures under Article 299."]
